WEBVTT

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:47.760
Hooray!

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:50.570
Listen!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.500
I've got a job!

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:57.660
<b><i>Promise to Sirius</i></b>

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:55.920
A gravure ad?

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:58.460
Yes, a lipstick ad.

00:01:58.460 --> 00:01:59.640
Lipstick?

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:04.890
It sounds like a mature, strong, and manly job.

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:06.890
Mature?

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:10.350
Strong?

00:02:12.350 --> 00:02:13.900
And manly?

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:21.870
Well, then. Things are starting to get busy.

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:24.160
Practice, practice.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.020
What is he going to practice?

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:28.620
It's impossible. There's no way.

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:32.880
It's a little different from what I'd expect from Shinomiya.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:35.670
A little different? It's the exact opposite.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:38.470
Oh, guys.

00:02:39.860 --> 00:02:41.050
What's up?

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:46.770
I just heard from Mr. Tsukimiya...

00:02:47.240 --> 00:02:50.800
What? An offer for Satsuki?

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:58.900
Their cameraman saw the concert hijacking on TV

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.280
and took a liking to Shinomiya.

00:03:02.310 --> 00:03:03.570
This isn't good.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:05.830
What? What's wrong?

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:12.250
I guess you guys should know too.

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.250
What?

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:18.090
His personality changes when he takes off his glasses?

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.130
Then, at that HAYATO concert...

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:27.680
Now that you mention it, he wasn't wearing his glasses then.

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:30.140
Why does his personality change?

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.990
I don't know.

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:35.480
He doesn't remember anything that happens while he's Satsuki, either.

00:03:37.340 --> 00:03:42.180
That explains why Shinomiya never says anything about that concert.

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.410
In any case, once he becomes Satsuki, no one can stop him.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.120
The only way to turn him back into Natsuki is to put his glasses back on.

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:51.780
What a surprise.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:52.910
I'm worried.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:58.460
They'll ask Shinomiya to be Satsuki on set.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:01.760
We can't talk to Natsuki about this, can we?

00:04:02.070 --> 00:04:05.660
He's got to do it himself somehow.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:12.430
Piyo, Piyo, Piyo.

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:14.270
Piyo, Piyo.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:18.190
Nice to meet you, Piyo's eggs.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:22.110
Piyo's eggs are on sale now.

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:24.400
They're delicious.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:27.660
What do you think, Shou?

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.540
You filmed this commercial a while ago.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:32.430
It's pretty good.

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:33.910
Anyway, you're not acting in this, are you?

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:37.170
Is it that obvious?

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.670
Of course it is.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.350
More importantly, if you act like yourself at this gravure job,

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:42.820
you'll mess it up.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.120
Be careful.

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:45.430
I know that.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:49.030
By the way, Shou, what are you reading?

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:50.320
Fan letters.

00:04:50.320 --> 00:04:51.760
I see.

00:04:51.760 --> 00:04:55.720
It makes me so happy to know there are people cheering me on.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:58.020
I've got to work even harder.

00:04:59.810 --> 00:05:01.150
Shou.

00:05:05.570 --> 00:05:08.740
<i>He worked so hard by himself that time.</i>

00:05:09.470 --> 00:05:12.990
<i>Shou keeps getting stronger and stronger.</i>

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.140
I need to work hard too.

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:22.000
Oh, right. I've got work on the day of your shoot, so I can't go.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.410
I asked Nanami to go with you instead.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:24.710
What?

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:28.530
You want me to go with Haru?

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.300
Do a good job.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.360
Wanting to change, but unable to change
 Good bye to this heart
 I want to shine stronger than Sirius
 Let me promise you forever

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.370
It's finally finished.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:47.610
Shinomiya.

00:05:50.220 --> 00:05:51.520
Haru.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:59.010
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:59.010 --> 00:06:03.090
It's all right. I came too early.

00:06:03.910 --> 00:06:08.070
Going out with you is like a dream, so I...

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:12.050
Oh, thank you for going out of your way for me today.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.920
It's fine.

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:16.810
I was just thinking I'd like to get out.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:20.060
Actually, I was just with Tomo earlier.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.200
I see.

00:06:24.200 --> 00:06:26.980
You two are such great friends.

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:31.950
Haru.

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:35.350
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:06:35.350 --> 00:06:36.160
Okay.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:41.000
Today, I want you to be only my Haru.

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:42.290
What?

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:46.100
I love you so, so much.

00:06:46.100 --> 00:06:48.720
I want you all to myself.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:51.640
You understand, don't you?

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:53.640
I-I see...

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.140
Good.

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.060
Oh, right.

00:06:58.380 --> 00:07:01.770
I wanted to show you this.

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:07.610
This...

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:12.780
I wrote lyrics to the song you gave me.

00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:18.130
What? You really wrote this, Shinomiya?

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:18.850
Yes.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.440
They're amazing.

00:07:20.440 --> 00:07:25.090
These lyrics are overflowing with such strength

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:28.460
that I can't imagine them coming from your usual self.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.860
They have such resolve...

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:34.060
What? You can tell?

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:36.420
Yes, somehow.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:44.000
The truth is, I feel like someone's been protecting me all my life.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:48.530
But I know I can't go on this way.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.880
That's why I want to become stronger.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:59.240
I'll become stronger. Someday I'll...

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:07.270
I'm sorry for springing this on you.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:09.750
It's all right.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:16.430
Haru, will you support me?

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:19.390
Yes, of course.

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:25.600
Thank you. Hearing you say that gives me great strength.

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.780
It's good, but something's not right.

00:08:35.130 --> 00:08:37.470
Shinomiya, look over here.

00:08:37.470 --> 00:08:40.290
Be wilder, like you're roaring.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:42.300
Shinomiya's shoot has started!

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.950
Natsuki's shoot started.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:47.000
I see.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:50.750
If you keep worrying about others, you'll fail.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:54.720
I know.

00:08:55.960 --> 00:08:58.430
Be wild and hot.

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:00.470
Hotter, hotter!

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:05.310
Shinomiya, you're different from what I saw the other day.

00:09:05.470 --> 00:09:08.280
Don't hold back. Give it your all!

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:09.440
Everything.

00:09:09.440 --> 00:09:10.270
Okay.

00:09:10.620 --> 00:09:12.510
It's a man's strength.

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.300
Strong, strong.

00:09:14.850 --> 00:09:16.950
Don't forget the pheromones.

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.380
Okay, it's lunch time.

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:20.440
Take a break.

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.790
Good work.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.640
He's tenacious, isn't he?

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:25.660
But we're counting on you.

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:27.620
Counting on me?

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.200
Eat your lunch, and let's change gears.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.130
Okay.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:36.800
This is pathetic.

00:09:37.890 --> 00:09:40.900
It's hard being strong, isn't it?

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:43.610
I can't...

00:09:43.610 --> 00:09:44.910
You can do it.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.230
You can do it, Shinomiya.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:52.440
It was overflowing from those lyrics...

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:59.130
Your strong desire to change.

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.570
You're right.

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.000
You're exactly right.

00:10:06.850 --> 00:10:10.330
I can't get discouraged here.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:12.300
I'll do my best.

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:15.580
I want to help you, Shinomiya.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.630
You can ask me for anything.

00:10:17.630 --> 00:10:18.840
Thank you, Haru.

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.680
The truth is, I have a secret plan.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:26.960
The cameraman just suggested I take off my glasses.

00:10:26.960 --> 00:10:30.400
I think it will change my aura too.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:31.670
What?

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.570
You think you can help Natsuki?

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.120
S-Satsuki.

00:10:50.980 --> 00:10:53.940
I'm the one protecting Natsuki...

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:56.420
from everyone who tries to hurt him.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.760
People like you are the most dangerous.

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:05.260
Those who pretend to be kind and approach Natsuki.

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:08.830
<i>Natsuki, you're very good.</i>

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:12.140
<i>Let me listen to the song you wrote some time.</i>

00:11:12.140 --> 00:11:17.830
<i>Amazing! I'm so happy to have a student like you.</i>

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:19.660
<i>You can ask me for anything.</i>

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:23.240
<i>I'll help you, Natsuki.</i>

00:11:32.430 --> 00:11:38.160
That woman stole the precious song Natsuki wrote and disappeared.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.520
I was born from Natsuki's despair.

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:45.600
I will stand in for Natsuki.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:55.940
Let's continue where we left off.

00:12:09.560 --> 00:12:10.870
Natsuki.

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:12.790
I'm done with work, so I came.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:21.950
Natsuki, where are your glasses?

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:24.540
That's not Natsuki. It's Satsuki!

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:25.640
What?!

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:36.650
Don't interfere!

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:39.860
Nanami!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:44.020
Satsuki, you jerk!

00:12:50.540 --> 00:12:51.950
I can't do it!

00:12:54.710 --> 00:12:56.050
Shinomiya.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:12:58.000
Right, the glasses.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:10.540
<i>Natsuki, I'll turn you back to normal right now.</i>

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:22.400
Ichinose?

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:24.590
Sorry to bother you while you're recording.

00:13:24.590 --> 00:13:26.830
We finished and just arrived.

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:28.740
Come to the roof as soon as you can.

00:13:30.230 --> 00:13:31.030
Is something wrong?

00:13:31.030 --> 00:13:32.470
I'll tell you later.

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.560
Could Shinomiya have...

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:43.300
Be careful, Otoya!

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:45.630
Okay.

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:52.930
What is this?

00:13:53.550 --> 00:13:54.960
Hijirikawa, Ren!

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:04.110
Ren!

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.110
Kurusu!

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:10.990
All right!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:24.590
What?!

00:14:41.160 --> 00:14:43.060
Wait, Satsuki! Where are you going?

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:46.270
To work, in place of Natsuki.

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.910
You can't do that.

00:14:47.910 --> 00:14:50.860
If it's going to hurt him, I'll do it.

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:51.900
Please wait!

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:53.620
Let go!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.910
I'll make your fingers useless.

00:14:56.220 --> 00:14:58.620
I'll never let go!

00:15:08.280 --> 00:15:09.670
Wait, Satsuki!

00:15:11.220 --> 00:15:12.490
Nanami, are you okay?

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:13.340
Satsuki!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:14.610
Wait!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.970
Open up, Satsuki!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:17.300
Shinomiya can do it himself!

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:16.790
Open this door!

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:17.720
Open up!

00:15:17.300 --> 00:15:20.140
Satsuki, please have faith in Shinomiya!

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:23.990
Look! Look at this!

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:29.280
Shinomiya wrote these lyrics.

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:34.750
"I sing for you"?

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:37.990
This is a song for you.

00:15:38.220 --> 00:15:42.750
No. This song is for you, Satsuki.

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:45.100
Me?

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:51.000
"I feel like we can become one if I reach out my hand.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.310
I want to walk together.

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:55.760
The power to protect."

00:15:56.050 --> 00:16:00.220
This is how Shinomiya truly feels.

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:06.660
<i>Wanting to change, but unable to change.</i>

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:10.710
<i>Good bye to this heart.</i>

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:15.050
Natsuki told me...

00:16:15.050 --> 00:16:18.560
He feels like he's always been protected by someone his whole life.

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:23.520
Please value Natsuki's feelings.

00:16:25.220 --> 00:16:29.070
Shinomiya is trying to change.

00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:32.590
He's trying to become stronger.

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:37.240
<i>Natsuki is trying to become stronger?</i>

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:41.530
<i>Natsuki should be fine as long as he has me.</i>

00:16:43.390 --> 00:16:46.670
<i>Natsuki changed while I wasn't looking...</i>

00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:48.520
<i>Why?</i>

00:16:52.060 --> 00:16:52.970
<i>Let go!</i>

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.990
<i>I'll never let go!</i>

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:02.250
You're so serious about Natsuki...

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:03.690
What?

00:17:07.130 --> 00:17:09.300
Oh, Haruka and Natsuki.

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:10.860
What are you doing?

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:11.950
Cecil?

00:17:11.950 --> 00:17:13.540
Are those glasses?!

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:15.130
Don't they look good on me?

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:18.470
I learned disguises are a fundamental of being an idol.

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:24.130
I understand why Natsuki likes you.

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.900
Satsuki.

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:38.640
Huh? What are you doing, Cecil?

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:41.710
Haru?

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:43.680
Are you all right?

00:17:43.680 --> 00:17:45.160
Yes.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:00.870
Good, good.

00:18:00.870 --> 00:18:02.720
You're so wild, Shinomiya.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.500
Thank you.

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:08.210
Where did you get those sunglasses?

00:18:08.210 --> 00:18:11.870
This is exactly what I wanted. It's perfect.

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:14.070
My sunglasses...

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:17.140
Who cares? Everything wrapped up nicely.

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:18.690
Nicely?

00:19:53.930 --> 00:19:55.640
Haru!

00:19:55.640 --> 00:19:57.090
Shinomiya.

00:19:58.370 --> 00:20:00.540
They're going to let me sing

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.400
the song you wrote for me on a music program.

00:20:03.400 --> 00:20:05.420
What? That's amazing!

00:20:05.420 --> 00:20:07.680
The gravure shoot was well received too.

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:11.000
That's great, Shinomiya.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:16.840
I feel like I gained something doing this job.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.400
It's all thanks to you, Haru.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.860
Not at all.

00:20:21.180 --> 00:20:23.860
I couldn't have done it alone.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:25.490
I'm grateful.

00:20:26.110 --> 00:20:27.760
Shinomiya.

00:20:28.550 --> 00:20:30.790
Well, I'm off to practice my singing.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:32.660
Shinomiya.

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.500
I look forward to the music show.

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:38.370
Me too.

00:20:38.370 --> 00:20:39.500
I'll see you later.

00:20:44.150 --> 00:20:46.650
Did Shinomiya change?

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:48.610
Everyone...

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:50.910
He looks the same to me.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:54.520
But he looked good at the shoot.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:57.650
Yeah. I had no idea Natsuki could do something like that.

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:02.170
I think I understand.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:09.660
Satsuki must have understood Shinomiya's strength.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:14.700
In other words, Satsuki's change affected Shinomiya, as well.

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.370
It's possible.

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:20.320
But Natsuki hasn't changed, right?

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.730
Fundamentally, no.

00:21:22.730 --> 00:21:24.380
I see. That's good.

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:50.070
Aijima.

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.960
Where is your assignment?

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:54.720
It's finished and on the desk.

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.460
100 Rules to Being an Idol

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:57.460
Aijima Cecil

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:07.690
Aijima, answer the door.

00:22:08.690 --> 00:22:09.720
Yes?

00:22:10.450 --> 00:22:11.640
Haruka.

00:22:13.030 --> 00:22:14.970
Um, here.

00:22:15.550 --> 00:22:19.230
I know it's late, but please accept it.

00:22:19.230 --> 00:22:20.270
For me?

00:22:21.370 --> 00:22:23.660
You wrote a song for me...

00:22:24.710 --> 00:22:25.990
I'm so happy, Haruka.

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:28.140
Thank you.

00:22:28.140 --> 00:22:30.860
I hope you like it.

00:22:30.860 --> 00:22:32.580
Of course I'll like it.
